#   Minimal .gitignore for Overleaf-hosted repositories
#   Excludes local LaTeX/BibTeX build artefacts and a few cross-platform
#   nuisances. Overleaf compiles LaTeX server-side, so these files should
#   never be pushed back to the Overleaf remote.

#   macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?

#   TeX / LaTeX / BibTeX build artefacts
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.nav
*.out
*.gz
*.snm
*.toc
*.bak
*synctex*
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.xdv

#   VSCode
.vscode/*
*.code-workspace